# Todo 3.4 — Auth-gated personal dashboard view (wave 3)

Date: 2026-08-17
Branch: feat/resume-analyser
Commit: (pending — see git log)

## Scope delivered
- `src/lib/dashboard-data.ts` (NEW) — pure data derivation: `kpiStats`,
  `scoreTrend`, `sectionBreakdown`, `recentRows`, `activityItems`. All helpers
  consume `AnalysisHistoryRow[]` (newest-first from `loadHistory`); charts
  reverse to oldest→newest; `sectionBreakdown` normalizes earned points to
  0–100 (keywords weight 45, structure 17) and emits date-only strings so
  `formatDate`/`parseIsoCalendarDate` (formater.ts) never see an Invalid Date.
- `src/lib/__tests__/dashboard-data.test.ts` (NEW) — 15 tests (empty history,
  single/multi-row KPIs, divide-by-zero guard, window clipping, ordering,
  format uppercasing, missing category keys).
- Dashboard components wired to real rows: `stats.tsx` (kpiStats + truthful
  footers "vs first analysis"/"all time"), `score-trend-chart.tsx`,
  `section-breakdown-chart.tsx`, `recent-analyses.tsx` (recentRows + "Back to
  analyser" → landing), `recent-activity.tsx` (activityItems + formatDate),
  `dashboard-empty.tsx` (onNavigate → landing).
- `src/components/dashboard.tsx` — `Dashboard({ userId, onNavigate })` loads
  via `loadHistory(getSupabase(), userId)` in useEffect; `getSupabase()` is
  wrapped in try/catch (throws without `.env.local` — Todo 2.3 lesson);
  loading / error / empty (DashboardEmpty full-width) / data states.
- `src/components/layout/Header.tsx` — optional `view`/`onNavigate` props
  (defaults keep existing consumers/tests valid); signed-in "Dashboard" link
  next to the Analyse CTA (same pattern as Sign in); nav links + Analyse CTA
  + logo switch back to landing and scroll via `goToSection`.
- `src/App.tsx` — `view` state ('landing' default); effect redirects
  signed-out users away from 'dashboard'; render guard `view === 'dashboard'
  && user` prevents a dashboard flash with no user.
- `src/components/__tests__/Header.test.tsx` — +4 tests (no Dashboard link
  signed out; Dashboard link shown signed in; click → onNavigate('dashboard');
  aria-current="page" when dashboard view active).

