## QA — guest path (unblocked, dev server :5201)
- Signed out → header shows "Sign in" + "Analyse" only; NO "Dashboard" link
  (verified via Playwright accessibility snapshot; the only "Dashboard" text
  on the page is the Footer privacy copy, which is expected).
- Landing renders; console: 0 errors, 1 warning (pre-existing).
- Screenshot: `.omo/evidence/ext-3-4-signedout-header.png`.
- Forced-dashboard redirect: covered by the App effect + render guard
  (`view === 'dashboard' && user`); signed-out users cannot render the
  dashboard view.

## QA — signed-in happy path (DEFERRED — blocked on Todo 2.1)
- Full journey (sign in → Dashboard link → dashboard with KPI/charts/table,
  screenshot `ext-3-4-dashboard.png`) requires a live Supabase project:
  `.env.local` is missing (Todo 2.1 provisioning). `getSupabase()` throws
  without `VITE_SUPABASE_URL`/`VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`, so the dashboard
  degrades to the error state until provisioned.
- Empty-history empty-state render also requires a signed-in session.
- Re-run when Todo 2.1 is provisioned (user supplies `sbp_` PAT + env vars).

